# =============================================================================
#  Industry 5.0 research project — .gitignore
# =============================================================================

# --- Raw datasets -------------------------------------------------------------
# Not committed: large, and each has its own licence and canonical source.
# Provenance is recorded in docs/10-data-card.md so anyone can re-download them.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep

# --- Literature ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Copyrighted PDFs. Downloaded for reading only — must NOT be redistributed
# through a public repository. Full citations live in paper/references.bib.
literature/*.pdf

# --- Build scratch ---------------------------------------------------------
.paper_template_tmp.docx

# --- Archives -----------------------------------------------------------------
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.7z

# --- Python -------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- Streamlit ----------------------------------------------------------------
.streamlit/secrets.toml

# --- OS -----------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- Editors ------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# =============================================================================
#  DELIBERATELY TRACKED (do not add these to the ignore list)
# =============================================================================
#   data/processed/   simulation inputs — small, and needed to reproduce results
#   results/          raw_results.csv and analysis outputs
#   figures/          paper figures
#   src/config.yaml   every parameter used in the experiments
# =============================================================================
